7226	    /// `child_waiters`, never in the run queue, so the run-queue removal the
7227	    /// polling disposition performs does not apply to it. Before this case was
7228	    /// handled, a signal aimed at such a thread was recorded nowhere and a wait
7229	    /// on a child that never exits could not be interrupted at all.
